<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>~ BOARD GAME MULTIVERSE ~</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=VT323&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #000;
            background-image: url('https://64.media.tumblr.com/d9573aea3bf4d7386b42ddd516ea1ce6/147bfebdf112f180-78/s250x400/6895a383d6d2b83a717218a904480bd772fcc875.gif');
            color: #fff;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .back-link {
            position: fixed;
            top: 10px;
            left: 10px;
            color: #ff00ff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 1px solid #ff00ff;
            padding: 5px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive;
            color: #ff00ff;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px #00ffff;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
            padding: 10px 40px;
            border: 3px double #ff00ff;
        }

        /* --- SHELF LAYOUT --- */
        .game-shelf {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .game-box {
            width: 150px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .game-box:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .game-box img {
            width: 120px;
            height: 160px;
            border: 4px outset #ccc;
            object-fit: cover;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
        }

        .game-label {
            margin-top: 10px;
            background: #000;
            color: #00ff00;
            font-family: 'VT323';
            font-size: 18px;
            border: 1px solid #00ff00;
        }

        .locked {
            filter: grayscale(1) brightness(0.5);
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }

        /* --- CHESS MANIFEST WINDOW --- */
        #chess-window {
            display: none; /* Hidden until clicked */
            background: #c0c0c0;
            border: 3px outset #ffffff;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 800px;
            box-shadow: 10px 10px 0px #000;
            position: absolute;
            top: 50px;
            z-index: 2000;
            color: #000;
        }

        .title-bar {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #800080, #ff00ff);
            color: white;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            max-height: 70vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            background: #fff;
            margin: 5px;
            border: 2px inset #808080;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .close-btn {
            background: #c0c0c0;
            border: 2px outset #fff;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            line-height: 14px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        h2 { border-bottom: 2px solid #000; padding-bottom: 5px; font-family: 'VT323'; }
        .poem { white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 30px; color: #333; }
        .cipher-box { background: #eee; padding: 10px; border: 1px dashed #000; font-family: monospace; }
        .moves-list { background: #000; color: #00ff00; padding: 15px; font-family: 'VT323'; font-size: 20px; }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="index.html" class="back-link"><< RETURN TO GAMMA CORRECTION</a>

    <h1>board game multiverse</h1>

    <div class="game-shelf">
        <div class="game-box" onclick="openChess()">
            <img src="https://blob.gifcities.org/gifcities/5HGKFNMUZTRZK2UQY5TTDPB3RJT3NEGU.gif" alt="Sacred Chess">
            <div class="game-label">WAR OF THE IVORIES</div>
        </div>

        <div class="game-box locked">
            <img src="https://blob.gifcities.org/gifcities/7ZSOXANPI7SSSJOESCTBXB22OE4XWQ6X.gif" alt="Locked">
            <div class="game-label">AL-QIRKAT (LOCKED)</div>
        </div>

        <div class="game-box locked">
            <img src="https://web.archive.org/web/20090829113543/http://geocities.com/SiliconValley/6502/dice.gif" alt="Locked">
            <div class="game-label">GAMBIT OF FATE</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="chess-window">
        <div class="title-bar">
            <span>CHESS_MANIFEST.EXE - THE GRAND WAR</span>
            <div class="close-btn" onclick="closeChess()">X</div>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2>THE POEM OF THE EBONIES AND IVORIES</h2>
            <div class="poem">
To the Hand up above which moves us in His grand eternal plan  
And the Sixty Four Squares down below which contain Woman and Man  
We chronicle the grand War of the Ebonies and Ivories  
And we intone today so our future kin will know these stories  

Our Ebony King was always strong and steadfast in his gambit  
While their Ivory King was cunning and scheming from his ambit  
Our Ebony Queen was our King's most fair and beautiful consort  
While their Ivory Queen was most cruel and depraved in her court  

Our King knew his Queen and begat fourteen loyal souls to the Squares  
First the Rook twins, Karadeva and Karasimha, as his heirs  
The Bishop sisters, Panishri and Panimati be their name  
Two Knights, Hastapala and Karasena, blessed with divine aim  

...[Archive continues]...

Panishri ended the life of vile Hastaksha once and for all  
Karavikranta moved Kara-Vijaya with traitorous gall  
Our Queen then took Madhyama-Vijaya in a glorious move  
Evil Karavikranta met Hastajit in his act to remove  

While Karavikranta slew Panimati with his wicked guile  
Our Queen made her grand sacrifice, opening up the holy file  
The Ivory Queen moved to capture her, taking the royal claim  
Panishri marched to Tarjani-Kriya, ending the foul King's name!
            </div>

            <h2>THE CIPHER</h2>
            <div class="cipher-box">
                <b>Files (a–h):</b> A: Angushtha, B: Tarjani, C: Madhyama, D: Anamika, E: Kanishtha, F: Kara, G: Pani, H: Hasta<br>
                <b>Ranks (1–8):</b> 1: Mula, 2: Prana, 3: Kriya, 4: Dharma, 5: Yuddha, 6: Vijaya, 7: Shraddha, 8: Moksha
            </div>

            <h2>RECORDED MOVES</h2>
            <div class="moves-list">
                1. b4 a5 | 2. Nc3 Ra6 | 3. Ba3 axb4 | 4. Bxb4 Rxa2 <br>
                5. Bxe7 Qxe7 | 6. Nd5 Qe4 | 7. Nxc7+ Kd8 | 8. f3 Qe7 <br>
                9. Rxa2 d5 | 10. Nxd5 Qe8 | 11. Ne7 Be6 | 12. Nxg8 Bxa2 <br>
                13. Nf6 Qc6 | 14. Nxh7 Bb3 | 15. Nxf8 Qxc2 | 16. Qxc2 Bxc2
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function openChess() {
            document.getElementById('chess-window').style.display = 'block';
        }
        function closeChess() {
            document.getElementById('chess-window').style.display = 'none';
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
